scription":"Celtic Kings: Rage of War is an RTS classic by Haemimont Games, originally released in 2002\n\nJulius Caesar wants to expand his already massive empire and he has his sights set on the lush countryside of Gaul. Celtic Kings: Rage of war brings you the excitement of the Roman conquests in two modes: strategic and adventure. \n\nIn strategic mode, you play as either the Romans or the Gauls in a world where tactical and strategic maneuveres are the key to victory. In adventure mode you take on the role of Larax and the battle the warring tribes who have raided your village and killed your wife. \n\nTwo exciting game modes, one action-packed conquest - let the best warrior win! \n\n• A great mixture of two genres - adventure and real-time strategy\n\n• Beautifully stylized 2D graphics\n\n• An inspiring storyline set during the Gallic Wars","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/827000/header.jpg?t=1594028372"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/827000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1594028372"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/827000/ss_129078ddee3fac2aaf464d96cabd7d70a715ab95.600x338.jpg?t=1594028372","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/827000/ss_129078ddee3fac2aaf464d96cabd7d70a715ab95.1920x1080.jpg?t=1594028372"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/827000/ss_e926c54a9320476eb0a5dfb7d567e83f2c7c7f80.600x338.jpg?t=1594028372","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/827000/ss_e926c54a9320476eb0a5dfb7d567e83f2c7c7f80.1920x1080.jpg?t=1594028372"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s